$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture The Flag" @
	"\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Tombaugh V" @
	"\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Hazy" @
	"\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @
	"\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	"\n\n<f1>Briefing: <f0> The military made a new way of fighting it is called AA Fighting. Your team went through the training and you all passed you are now called AA Fighters. You fight from high places and you do it as a team. First take out all the door gens to get access to the enemy Sky Base then take the flag and capture it 5 times. Now for the real combat!";